# firm-bot benchmark vs naive baseline

## Aggregate

| Chunker | mean precision@k | mean keyword coverage | p50 retrieval | p95 retrieval |
|---------|------------------|----------------------|---------------|---------------|
| `firm_bot` | 0.627 | 0.605 | 3.6 ms | 4.9 ms |
| `naive` | 0.610 | 0.619 | 3.3 ms | 3.5 ms |
